e-cells = <0>;\" typical for LED controller.\n\nZephyr's example overlay for PWM LEDs: In boards/nrf52/pca10056/pwm-leds.overlay they have something like:\n\n/ {\n    pwm_leds: leds {\n        compatible = \"pwm-leds\";\n        led0: led_0 {\n            label = \"LED0\";\n            pwms = <&pwm0 0 1000000>;\n        };\n    };\n};\n\nThus we can do:\n\n/ {\n    pwm_leds: leds {\n        compatible = \"pwm-leds\";\n\n        green_led: green_led {\n            label = \"green-led\";\n            pwms = <&pwm0 0 20000000>;\n        };\n    };\n};\n\nThus output only overlay content.\n\nLet's produce final answer."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"queue_time": 0.01745564, "prompt_tokens": 155, "prompt_time": 0.005899176, "completion_tokens": 628, "completion_time": 1.311717003, "total_tokens": 783, "total_time": 1.317616179, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 566}}, "usage_breakdown": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_c800245357", "x_groq": {"id": "req_01ktj13gkrfhmbfwbgr1prmq98", "seed": 1467105753}, "service_tier": "on_demand"}


